-------

Each module was written and tested separately before being coupled to
the others. Each retains its unit-test and its main(), guarded by
#ifdef TESTMODULE_<NAME>: six survive, in xpost_name.c, xpost_dict.c,
xpost_array.c, xpost_string.c, xpost_save.c and xpost_garbage.c. No
build defines any of those symbols, so none of them is compiled. They
are readable and stale in equal measure; the tests that run are in
